{"path":"coroutine/generator/generator","title":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::generator","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::generator&lt;Ref,V,Allocator&gt;::</span>generator","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/coroutine/generator/generator","section":"coroutine","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">generator<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> generator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> delete<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">generator<span class=\"br0\">(</span> generator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> other <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Constructs a <code>generator</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The copy-constructor is deleted.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> The move-constructor that initializes the underlying <a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator#Data_members\"><code><i>coroutine_</i></code></a> with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/exchange\"><span class=\"kw1126\">std::<span class=\"me2\">exchange</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>other.<span class=\"me1\">coroutine_</span>, <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>, and the underlying stack of coroutine handles (<a href=\"/w/cpp/coroutine/generator#Data_members\"><code><i>active_</i></code></a>) with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/exchange\"><span class=\"kw1126\">std::<span class=\"me2\">exchange</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>other.<span class=\"me1\">active_</span>, nullptr<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\nNote, that the iterators, previously obtained from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">other</span></code>, are not invalidated, but become iterators into <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> other\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a generator object to be moved in\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"coroutine","title":"Coroutine support (C++20)"},{"path":"coroutine/generator","title":"std::generator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::generator<Ref,V,Allocator>::generator","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Constructs a generator."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"other"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":80,"codeBlockCount":0}
